T: Moll Peatly the new Way
P: Longways for as many as will
%R: jig
B: "The Dancing-Master" printed by John Walsh, London
S: 6: CCDM1 http://imslp.org/wiki/The_Compleat_Country_Dancing-Master_(Various) V.1 p.21 #46
